{"Code":200,"Message":"operation success","MoreMessage":"","TipType":"Success","Count":15,"ReturnUrl":null,"Data":[{"Id":"8f06ec10-406c-4691-9582-f81f91ac5e25","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":351573633,"PostDateInt":0,"PostDate":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"安全运营专家(J14064)","OrgId":748547,"Org":null,"Category":null,"CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":[],"Salary":null,"Duty":"1、分析研判类：能够针对安全设备发现的告警日志进行分析，通过分析日志的数据包特征，确定告警事件是否有攻击行为，针对攻击行为事件能够研判是否攻击成功。\n2、应急溯源类：熟练掌握系统及设备的日志分析，恶意代码行为分析、攻击路径分析、病毒查杀等应急溯源分析及处置技能，并出具完整的攻击溯源分析报告。\n3、安全运营技术：了解常见的安全运营技术，熟练掌握”平战结合“类的的安全运营框架，并具有该框架实践项目。\n4、沟通能力：能够沟通清楚了解客户的需求，针对需求开展对应工作并达到客户要求。\n5、文档编辑能力：能够按照客户模板编辑完整的漏洞解决方案、渗透测试类、分析研判类、应急溯源类报告。\n6、熟练掌握高级级别具备的技能，同时在此基础上针对项目成员进行技能培训传递。\n7、带领团队优化提升项目技术，同时按照客户安全现状，提出建设性意见，并按照意见落地实施。","Require":"1、熟悉当前主流网络安全设备设施工作原理，如态势感知、防病毒网关、防火墙等。\n2、熟练掌握网络协议、熟练使用抓包分析工具，能够独立开展网络安全事件分析、追踪和溯源等研判工作。\n3、具备攻防能力，熟练使用攻防工具，并具备失陷研判能力，对攻击成功与否的研判能力。\n4、具有良好的沟通能力。\n5、参与过重大安全保障值守工作、应急响应者优先。\n6、有10年及以上网络安全工作经验优先。\n7、具有CISP-PTE证书、CISP证书优先。","ClassificationOne":null,"ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":null,"Channel4IsHot":true,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":true,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-06-05T10:48:14","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null},{"Id":"b05b54b6-1fe6-42dc-ae54-30b2adfa1624","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":351520621,"PostDateInt":0,"PostDate":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"高级渗透测试工程师（红队方向）(J13630)","OrgId":748547,"Org":null,"Category":null,"CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":[],"Salary":null,"Duty":"1、负责各行业、省级、国家级等攻防演练工作；\n2、负责大型企业的渗透工作；\n3、负责大型企业红队评估工作；\n4、参与网络安全竞赛；\n5、前沿攻击技术的研究，攻击小工具的研发。","Require":"1、3年及以上相关经验，熟练掌握各种渗透测试工具并且对其原理有深入了解；\n2、具有丰富的实战经验可独立完成渗透测试工作；\n3、能从防御者或者运维人员的角度思考攻防问题，对后渗透有深入了解者更佳；\n4、熟悉常见 操作系统安全机制，具备一定的安全开发能力以及问题解决能力；\n5、对安全有浓厚的兴趣和较强的独立钻研能力，有良好的团队精神；\n6、在网络安全竞赛（CTF、AWD）方面有积累或获奖者优先；\n7、熟练掌握常见的攻防技术以及对相关漏洞的原理有深入的理解；\n8、至少掌握一门开发语言，操作语言不限，要求至少能上手写代码。","ClassificationOne":null,"ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":null,"Channel4IsHot":true,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":true,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2025-12-25T11:15:12","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null},{"Id":"a8f593ed-f63e-4ae2-9015-000a0e08f68b","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":351607276,"PostDateInt":0,"PostDate":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"Linux C开发工程师（数据安全方向）(J14406)","OrgId":946310,"Org":null,"Category":null,"CategoryId":"2","LocId":null,"LocNames":[],"Salary":null,"Duty":"1、参与公司网络安全产品（如数据库审计、网络审计等产品）的研发与维护工作；\n2、负责网络报文分析、解析相关开发及调试工作；\n3、负责产品功能模块的设计与开发、性能调优工作；\n4、负责已有模块的维护工作。","Require":"一、专业技能\n1、硕士研究生学历，计算机、软件工程、网络安全等相关专业；\n2、熟悉Linux操作系统，掌握Shell、Python等脚本开发语言，能够在Linux环境下进行开发和调试；\n3、精通Linux C开发，熟悉常用数据结构（链表、队列、哈希表等），在校期间有良好的编码习惯（如代码规范、注释清晰）；\n4、熟悉TCP/IP协议族，熟悉IP、TCP、UDP等基础协议的原理；熟悉Socket编程，熟练使用相关工具；\n5、熟悉网络安全基础知识，有报文深度检测系统源码分析经验、DPDK开发经验者优先考虑。\n\n二、优先条件\n1、有较强的动手能力，有实际项目开发经验或实习经验者优先\n2、参加过网络安全相关CTF竞赛、信息安全大赛并获奖者优先","ClassificationOne":null,"ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":null,"Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-09-02T10:44:27","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null},{"Id":"32b77871-6c32-4d0d-84dd-78f6b7a042de","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":351605818,"PostDateInt":0,"PostDate":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"Linux C开发工程师（通用开发）(J14398)","OrgId":946310,"Org":null,"Category":null,"CategoryId":"2","LocId":null,"LocNames":[],"Salary":null,"Duty":"1.根据总体设计完成模块设计； \n2.完成模块代码编写、单元测试、代码维护工作； \n3.编写技术文档，并对有关人员进行培训。","Require":"1.本科以上学历，计算机相关专业；\n2.熟悉ISO9000/CMMI规范，熟悉软件工程原理，具有软件质量意识；\n3.熟悉TCP/IP原理，有网络编程经验；\n4.熟悉linux环境下C/C++语言编程编程，有linux内核编程经验。","ClassificationOne":null,"ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":null,"Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-08-31T13:56:02","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null},{"Id":"a036a6bc-99f0-48ce-9040-6d4b6dd778e7","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":351605816,"PostDateInt":0,"PostDate":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"安全检测大模型研究员(J14399)","OrgId":946310,"Org":null,"Category":null,"CategoryId":"2","LocId":null,"LocNames":[],"Salary":null,"Duty":"1、跨部门团队协作，设计并建立数据清洗、评测及合成机制，持续迭代构建高质量、高多样性的训练数据集；\n2、训练、评测并优化模型能力，提升性能，获取最佳实践；\n3、持续优化强化学习算法，在预训练模型与数据既定的条件下，最大限度地释放基础模型潜力；\n4、跟踪前沿技术发展，研究探索大模型在网络安全领域的新应用。","Require":"1、计算机科学、人工智能、网络安全等相关专业硕士及以上学历，博士优先；\n2、熟悉深度学习、自然语言处理等技术，掌握主流深度学习框架，具备大模型训练、微调和部署经验；\n3、了解网络安全基本概念，熟悉常见安全威胁和检测机制；\n4、具备良好的研究、分析、创新和解决问题能力；\n5、有安全检测大模型研究经历者优先。","ClassificationOne":null,"ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":null,"Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-08-31T13:55:30","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null},{"Id":"e9d88de3-52cf-4b9d-bb01-570b619a3e1e","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":351605814,"PostDateInt":0,"PostDate":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"前沿领域安全研究员(J14401)","OrgId":946310,"Org":null,"Category":null,"CategoryId":"2","LocId":null,"LocNames":[],"Salary":null,"Duty":"1、跟踪研究具身智能、无人系统、人工智能安全等前沿领域的技术发展、国家政策和标准法规；\n2、参与国家级、省部级课题的项目规划、申报、项目组织与管理；\n3、根据项目计划及管理规范，进行项目沟通、协调，对项目进度及质量进行监督、检查;\n4、参与行业沙龙、技术论坛，传递公司在具身智能、无人系统、人工智能安全等具体场景的落地经验与最佳实践，引领行业标准制定，持续提升公司在人工智能安全生态中的技术影响力。","Require":"1、 硕士及以上学历，计算机、网络安全、人工智能等相关专业；\n2、 精通对抗性攻击防御、数据隐私保护、模型对齐或红队测试等至少一个人工智能安全细分方向；\n3、熟悉主流大模型架构，具备安全漏洞分析与防御方案落地能力；\n4、曾在ICML/NeurIPS/ACL/CVPR/Black Hat/DefCon等会议或峰会发表论文或担任Speaker，具备将复杂技术转化为行业可读内容的输出能力；\n5、 具备出色的英文读写与演讲能力，善于跨团队协作，对人工智能安全前沿趋势保持敏锐嗅觉。","ClassificationOne":null,"ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":n